    "thirdDieName": "Megalopolis’s Finest",
    "description": "<p><strong>Outdoor Press Conference</strong></p><p>The square outside City Hall: dozens of civilians, police, and local news teams gathered for the mayor’s speech. Twists and threats work against both heroes and opposition.</p><p><strong>Starting opposition:</strong> H robot “cops”, 2 Skeeterbots per hero, and H/2 Megalopolis Police Officers (rounded down). The first time the environment comes up, clone Mayor Baldwin and Police Commissioner Anselmo enter and turn on the heroes (revealed as flesh-creations as they take damage).</p><p><strong>Threats:</strong> Whenever the environment turn comes up, add one of the Outdoor Press Conference threats (Robot cops / Skeeterbots / Megalopolis Police Officers).</p><p><em>Trait dice use printed labels (Crowd of Civilians / Live News Feed / Megalopolis’s Finest); die sizes curated — confirm in book.</em></p>"
  },
